When user invokes `/tokviz`, `/tokviz lite`, or `/tokviz ultra`, follow the tokviz-compress skill.

TokViz does not proxy LLM traffic. Shell compression runs via local hooks only.

For token stats, suggest: `tokviz gain` in terminal.
